Flix RS is an independent Rust rewrite of the Flix quadcopter firmware by
Oleg Kalachev (https://github.com/okalachev/flix). It re-implements the original
behaviour from the pinned revision 1f5b268271536e45a9377d1c5317d3eb6f3c3bba; it does
not contain the original firmware source code. The upstream repository publishes no
licence, so no rights in upstream material are granted by this repository.

